# This repository is the commons front door: the catalog index, the gap ledger,
# and the founding documents. It holds nothing product-specific and no code.
#
# Products live in their own repositories (see catalog.json). The rules and the
# merge-gate tooling live in `governance`. Nothing from either is mirrored here
# -- a copy per repository is exactly the drift this project exists to prevent.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: implementation trees, build files, governance files.
# If one appears in `git status`, that is the point -- it is in the wrong
# repository and should be visible, not silently hidden.

node_modules/
dist/
.build/

.env
.env.*

# Editor and OS artifacts
*~
.DS_Store
.~lock.*#

# Claude Code worktrees and session state
.claude/

